    "id": "e7ffdcae-d294-5f7b-aa1a-a94b03e7e394",
    "title": "Build an AI Agent to Analyze IT Tickets with NVIDIA Nemotron",
    "link": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/build-an-ai-agent-to-analyze-it-tickets-with-nvidia-nemotron/",
    "pubDate": "2025-10-20T17:00:00+00:00",
    "description": "Modern organizations generate a massive volume of operational data through ticketing systems, incident reports, service requests, support escalations, and more....",
    "author": "Bhaskar Bhowmik",
    "sourceTitle": "Nvidia",
    "sourceUrl": "https://feeds.feedburner.com/nvidiablog",
    "sourceCategory": "Nvidia",
    "sourceType": "notice",
    "content": "<img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://developer-blogs.nvidia.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Itelligence-768x432-png.webp\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" title=\"Itelligence\" width=\"768\" />Modern organizations generate a massive volume of operational data through ticketing systems, incident reports, service requests, support escalations, and more....<img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://developer-blogs.nvidia.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Itelligence-768x432-png.webp\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" title=\"Itelligence\" width=\"768\" /><p>Modern organizations generate a massive volume of operational data through ticketing systems, incident reports, service requests, support escalations, and more. These tickets often hold critical signals about systemic issues, recurring pain points, and team performance. But extracting insights from them is a challenge. Most ticketing platforms are built for workflow execution, not analysis.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/build-an-ai-agent-to-analyze-it-tickets-with-nvidia-nemotron/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Source</a></p>",
    "image": "https://developer-blogs.nvidia.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Itelligence.png",
    "isShortVideo": 0
  },
